Skill, der Python und CLI verwendet, um Audio zu generieren","pt":"O que é alicloud-ai-audio-tts? É uma ferramenta de síntese de áudio que permite gerar áudio sintetizado","ru":"Что такое alicloud-ai-audio-tts? Это инструмент синтеза аудио, который позволяет генерировать синтезированное аудио","ar":"ما هي أداة أليكلود-إيه آي-أوديو-تي تي إس؟ هي أداة合성 الصوت التي تسمح بإنشاء صوت م 合ن"},"features":{"en":["Compiles TTS scripts using py_compile","Validates script compilation with output file generation","Generates text-to-speech audio files using Alibaba Cloud''s AI services","Saves audio links, sample audio files, and request payloads to output directory","Utilizes bash commands for script execution and validation","Supports Python-based development for custom TTS applications"],"zh":["使用Python脚本生成音频文件","支持CLI命令行操作","能够生成高质量的音频文件","使用深度学习算法进行音频合成","支持多种音频格式"],"ja":["Pythonスクリプトを使用して音声ファイルを生成","CLIコマンドライン操作をサポート","高品質の音声ファイルを生成","深度学習アルゴリズムを使用した音声合成","複数の音声フォーマットをサポート"],"ko":["Python 스크립트를 사용하여 오디오 파일을 생성","CLI 명령줄操作을 지원","높은 품질의 오디오 파일을 생성","딥러닝 알고리즘을 사용한 오디오 합성","여러 오디오 형식을 지원"],"es":["Generación de audio con Python","Uso de CLI para la ejecución de scripts","Compatibilidad con Alibaba Cloud","Validación de la generación de audio","Guardado de enlaces de audio y payloads de solicitud"],"fr":["Génération d''audio avec Python","Utilisation de la CLI pour l''exécution de scripts","Compatibilité avec Alibaba Cloud","Validation de la génération d''audio","Sauvegarde des liens d''audio et des payloads de requête"],"de":["Generierung von Audio mit Python","Verwendung von CLI für die Ausführung von Skripten","Kompatibilität mit Alibaba Cloud","Validierung der Audio-Generierung","Speicherung von Audio-Links und Anfrage-Payloads"],"pt":["Suporte a Python para desenvolvimento de scripts personalizados","Utilização de CLI para execução de comandos e gerenciamento de áudio","Geração de áudio sintetizado de alta qualidade","Compatibilidade com o modelo de estúdio Qwen TTS","Validação de comandos e geração de relatórios de saída"],"ru":["Поддержка Python для разработки пользовательских скриптов","Использование CLI для выполнения команд и управления аудио","Генерация синтезированного аудио высокого качества","Совместимость с моделью студии Qwen TTS","Валидация команд и генерация отчетов о выводе"],"ar":["دعم بايثون لتطوير البرامج النصية المخصصة","استخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر لتنفيذ الأوامر وإدارة الصوت","إنشاء صوت م 合ن عالي الجودة","التوافق مع نموذج استوديو Qwen TTS","التحقق من أوامر وإنشاء تقارير الإخراج"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use alicloud-ai-audio-tts","alicloud-ai-audio-tts setup guide","python text to speech library","alibaba cloud ai services","tts script compilation","py_compile tutorial","alicloud-ai-audio-tts alternative","text to speech audio generation","python audio processing"],"zh":["阿里云AI音频TTS","AI音频合成","Python音频生成","CLI音频操作","深度学习音频合成","高质量音频文件","音频格式支持"],"ja":["Alibaba Cloud AIエージェント","AI音声合成","Python音声生成","CLI音声操作","深度学習音声合成","高品質音声ファイル","音声フォーマットサポート"],"ko":["알리바바 클라우드 AI 오디오 TTS","AI 오디오 합성","Python 오디오 생성","CLI 오디오 운영","딥러닝 오디오 합성","높은 품질 오디오 파일","오디오 형식 지원"],"es":["alicloud-ai-audio-tts","Agentes de IA","desarrollo de audio","Python","CLI","Alibaba Cloud","generación de audio","validación de audio"],"fr":["alicloud-ai-audio-tts","Outils d''IA","développement d''audio","Python","CLI","Alibaba Cloud","génération d''audio","validation d''audio"],"de":["alicloud-ai-audio-tts","KI-Tools","Audio-Entwicklung","Python","CLI","Alibaba Cloud","Audio-Generierung","Audio-Validierung"],"pt":["alicloud-ai-audio-tts","síntese de áudio","Python","CLI","Qwen TTS","desenvolvimento de áudio","geração de áudio sintetizado","ferramentas de áudio","tecnologias de áudio"],"ru":["alicloud-ai-audio-tts","синтез аудио","Python","CLI","Qwen TTS","разработка аудио","генерация синтезированного аудио","инструменты аудио","технологии аудио"],"ar":["أليكلود-إيه آي-أوديو-تي تي إس","合成 الصوت","بايثون","واجهة سطر الأوامر","Qwen TTS","تطوير الصوت","إنشاء صوت م 合ن","أدوات الصوت","تقنيات الصوت"]}},"owner":"cinience","repo":"alicloud-skills","repoPath":"cinience/alicloud-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"alicloud-ai-audio-tts","description":"Generate human-like speech audio with Model Studio DashScope Qwen TTS models (qwen3-tts-flash, qwen3-tts-instruct-flash). Use when converting text to speech, producing voice lines for short drama/news videos, or documenting TTS request/response fields for DashScope.","bodyPreview":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts\npython -m py_compile skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/scripts/generate_tts.py && echo \"py_compile_ok\" > output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt\n```\n\nPass criteria: command exits 0 and `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt` is generated.\n\n## Output And Evidence\n\n- Save generated audio links, sample audio files, and request payloads to `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/`.\n- Keep one va","body":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts\npython -m py_compile skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/scripts/generate_tts.py && echo \"py_compile_ok\" > output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt\n```\n\nPass criteria: command exits 0 and `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/validate.txt` is generated.\n\n## Output And Evidence\n\n- Save generated audio links, sample audio files, and request payloads to `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/`.\n- Keep one validation log per execution.\n\n## Critical model names\n\nUse one of the recommended models:\n- `qwen3-tts-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Install SDK (recommended in a venv to avoid PEP 668 limits):\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv .venv\n. .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install dashscope\n```\n- Set `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` in your environment, or add `dashscope_api_key` to `~/.alibabacloud/credentials` (env takes precedence).\n\n## Normalized interface (tts.generate)\n\n### Request\n- `text` (string, required)\n- `voice` (string, required)\n- `language_type` (string, optional; default `Auto`)\n- `instruction` (string, optional; recommended for instruct models)\n- `stream` (bool, optional; default false)\n\n### Response\n- `audio_url` (string, when stream=false)\n- `audio_base64_pcm` (string, when stream=true)\n- `sample_rate` (int, 24000)\n- `format` (string, wav or pcm depending on mode)\n\n## Quick start (Python + DashScope SDK)\n\n```python\nimport os\nimport dashscope\n\n# Prefer env var for auth: export DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=...\n# Or use ~/.alibabacloud/credentials with dashscope_api_key under [default].\n# Beijing region; for Singapore use: https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\ndashscope.base_http_api_url = \"https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\"\n\ntext = \"Hello, this is a short voice line.\"\nresponse = dashscope.MultiModalConversation.call(\n    model=\"qwen3-tts-instruct-flash\",\n    api_key=os.getenv(\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"),\n    text=text,\n    voice=\"Cherry\",\n    language_type=\"English\",\n    instruction=\"Warm and calm tone, slightly slower pace.\",\n    stream=False,\n)\n\naudio_url = response.output.audio.url\nprint(audio_url)\n```\n\n## Streaming notes\n\n- `stream=True` returns Base64-encoded PCM chunks at 24kHz.\n- Decode chunks and play or concatenate to a pcm buffer.\n- The response contains `finish_reason == \"stop\"` when the stream ends.\n\n## Operational guidance\n\n- Keep requests concise; split long text into multiple calls if you hit size or timeout errors.\n- Use `language_type` consistent with the text to improve pronunciation.\n- Use `instruction` only when you need explicit style/tone control.\n- Cache by `(text, voice, language_type)` to avoid repeat costs.\n\n## Output location\n\n- Default output: `output/alicloud-ai-audio-tts/audio/`\n- Override base dir with `OUTPUT_DIR`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Confirm user intent, region, identifiers, and whether the operation is read-only or mutating.\n2) Run one minimal read-only query first to verify connectivity and permissions.\n3) Execute the target operation with explicit parameters and bounded scope.\n4) Verify results and save output/evidence files.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/api_reference.md` for parameter mapping and streaming example.\n- Realtime mode is provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-realtime/`.\n- Voice cloning/design are provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-clone/` and `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-design/`.\n\n- Source list: `references/sources.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:51.321Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Voice Assistant Agents needing advanced text-to-speech audio generation capabilities using Alibaba Cloud''s AI capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要使用阿里云 AI 能力的语音助手代理进行高级文本转语音音频生成的功能。","ja":"Alibaba Cloud の AI 機能を使用した高度なテキストから音声へのオーディオ生成機能を必要とする Voice Assistant エージェントに最適です。","ko":"알리바바 클라우드의 AI 기능을 사용하여 고급 텍스트를 음성으로 변환하는 오디오 생성 기능이 필요한 보이스 어시스턴트 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Asistentes de Voz que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de audio de texto a voz utilizando las capacidades de inteligencia artificial de Alibaba Cloud.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Assistant Vocal nécessitant des capacités avancées de génération audio texte-à-parole à l''aide des capacités d''intelligence artificielle d''Alibaba Cloud.","de":"Perfekt für Voice Assistant Agents, die erweiterte Text-to-Speech-Audio-Generierungsfunktionen unter Verwendung der KI-Funktionen von Alibaba Cloud benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Assistente de Voz que precisam de capacidades avançadas de geração de áudio de texto para fala usando as capacidades de IA da Alibaba Cloud.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов голосовых помощников, которым требуются расширенные возможности генерации текста в речь с помощью возможностей ИИ Alibaba Cloud.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المساعدين الصوتيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحويل النص إلى كلام باستخدام قدرات الذكاء الاصطناعي من Alibaba Cloud."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality text-to-speech audio using Python and Alibaba Cloud''s AI capabilities, supporting various audio processing tasks with protocols like HTTP requests and file formats such as WAV or MP3.","zh":"通过使用 Python 和阿里云的 AI 能力，赋予代理生成高质量的文本转语音音频的能力，支持各种音频处理任务，包括 HTTP 请求和 WAV 或 MP3 等文件格式。","ja":"Python と Alibaba Cloud の AI 機能を使用して、エージェントに高品質のテキストから音声へのオーディオを生成する能力を与え、HTTP リクエストや WAV または MP3 などのファイル形式など、さまざまなオーディオ処理タスクをサポートします。","ko":"파이썬과 알리바바 클라우드의 AI 기능을 사용하여 에이전트가 고품질의 텍스트를 음성으로 변환하는 오디오를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, HTTP 요청 및 WAV 또는 MP3와 같은 파일 형식과 같은 다양한 오디오 처리 작업을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar audio de texto a voz de alta calidad utilizando Python y las capacidades de inteligencia artificial de Alibaba Cloud, admitiendo varias tareas de procesamiento de audio con protocolos como solicitudes HTTP y formatos de archivo como WAV o MP3.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer un audio texte-à-parole de haute qualité en utilisant Python et les capacités d''intelligence artificielle d''Alibaba Cloud, en prenant en charge diverses tâches de traitement audio avec des protocoles tels que des requêtes HTTP et des formats de fichiers tels que WAV ou MP3.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, hochwertiges Text-to-Speech-Audio unter Verwendung von Python und den KI-Funktionen von Alibaba Cloud zu generieren, wodurch verschiedene Audioverarbeitungsaufgaben mit Protokollen wie HTTP-Anfragen und Dateiformaten wie WAV oder MP3 unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar áudio de texto para fala de alta qualidade usando Python e as capacidades de IA da Alibaba Cloud, suportando várias tarefas de processamento de áudio com protocolos como solicitações HTTP e formatos de arquivo como WAV ou MP3.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать высококачественный текст в речь с помощью Python и возможностей ИИ Alibaba Cloud, поддерживая различные задачи обработки аудио с протоколами như HTTP-запросы и форматы файлов, такие как WAV или MP3.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من生成 صوت نصي عالي الجودة باستخدام Python وقدرات الذكاء الاصطناعي من Alibaba Cloud، مع دعم مهام معالجة الصوت المختلفة ببروتوكولات مثل طلبات HTTP وتنسيقات الملفات مثل WAV أو MP3."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating audio responses for voice assistants","Creating text-to-speech audio for e-learning platforms","Automating audio content creation for podcasts"],"zh":["为语音助手生成音频响应","为电子学习平台创建文本转语音音频","自动化播客的音频内容创建"],"ja":["ボイスアシスタントのオーディオレスポンスを生成する","電子学習プラットフォーム向けのテキストから音声へのオーディオを生成する","ポッドキャストのオーディオコンテンツ作成を自動化する"],"ko":["보이스 어시스턴트를 위한 오디오 응답 생성","전자 학습 플랫폼을 위한 텍스트를 음성으로 변환하는 오디오 생성","팟캐스트의 오디오 콘텐츠 생성 자동화"],"es":["Generar respuestas de audio para asistentes de voz","Crear audio de texto a voz para plataformas de aprendizaje electrónico","Automatizar la creación de contenido de audio para podcasts"],"fr":["Générer des réponses audio pour les assistants vocaux","Créer un audio texte-à-parole pour les plateformes d''apprentissage en ligne","Automatiser la création de contenu audio pour les podcasts"],"de":["Generieren von Audio-Antworten für Voice Assistant","Erstellen von Text-to-Speech-Audio für E-Learning-Plattformen","Automatisieren der Erstellung von Audio-Inhalten für Podcasts"],"pt":["Gerar respostas de áudio para assistentes de voz","Criar áudio de texto para fala para plataformas de e-learning","Automatizar a criação de conteúdo de áudio para podcasts"],"ru":["Генерировать аудиоответы для голосовых помощников","Создавать текст в речь для платформ электронного обучения","Автоматизировать создание аудиоконтента для подкастов"],"ar":["توليد استجابات صوتية للمساعدين الصوتيين","إنشاء صوت نصي للكلام من أجل منصات التعلم الإلكتروني","ت 자동ة إنشاء محتوى صوتي للبودكاست"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Alibaba Cloud account and AI credentials","Python 3.x compatibility required","Dependent on Alibaba Cloud''s AI service availability"],"zh":["需要阿里云账户和 AI 凭证","需要 Python 3.x 兼容性","依赖于阿里云的 AI 服务可用性"],"ja":["Alibaba Cloud アカウントと AI 資格情報が必要","Python 3.x との互換性が必要","Alibaba Cloud の AI サービスの可用性に依存"],"ko":["알리바바 클라우드 계정 및 AI 자격 증명이 필요","파이썬 3.x 호환성이 필요","알리바바 클라우드의 AI 서비스 가용성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Alibaba Cloud y credenciales de inteligencia artificial","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x","Dependiente de la disponibilidad del servicio de inteligencia artificial de Alibaba Cloud"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Alibaba Cloud et des informations d''identification d''intelligence artificielle","La compatibilité Python 3.x est requise","Dépend de la disponibilité du service d''intelligence artificielle d''Alibaba Cloud"],"de":["Benötigt ein Alibaba Cloud-Konto und KI-Zugangsdaten","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Von der Verfügbarkeit des KI-Dienstes von Alibaba Cloud abhängig"],"pt":["Requer conta da Alibaba Cloud e credenciais de IA","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária","Dependente da disponibilidade do serviço de IA da Alibaba Cloud"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись Alibaba Cloud и учетные данные ИИ","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x","Зависит от доступности сервиса ИИ Alibaba Cloud"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Alibaba Cloud وأ凭وسات الذكاء الاصطناعي","متطلبات التوافق مع Python 3.x","يعتمد على توفر خدمة الذكاء الاصطناعي من Alibaba Cloud"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c1d17f87d7122cd092562245bf2c342966b47ca3fe947db9108bfced80e5b7fd","qualityScore":57}');
