":"B2C Sandbox は、Salesforce Commerce の On-demand sandboxes (ODS) を管理する AIエージェントです。","ko":"B2C Sandbox는 Salesforce Commerce의 On-demand sandboxes (ODS)를 관리하는 인공지능 에이전트입니다.","es":"Un skill de AI que permite la creación y eliminación de sandboxes de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","fr":"Un skill d''IA qui permet la création et la suppression de sandboxes de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","de":"Ein AI-Skill, der die Erstellung und Löschung von Sandboxes von Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand ermöglicht","pt":"O que é b2c-sandbox? É uma habilidade que fornece gerenciamento de sandboxes On-demand para Salesforce B2C Commerce","ru":"Что такое b2c-sandbox? Это ИИ Агент, обеспечивающий управление песочницами Salesforce B2C Commerce","ar":"ما هي ب2c-sandbox؟ هي وظيفة توفر إدارة بيئات التطوير المخصصة لشركة Salesforce B2C Commerce"},"features":{"en":["Uses the b2c CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes","Creates and deletes sandboxes only when explicitly requested","Confirms destructive actions to prevent accidental sandbox deletion","Supports the ods prefix as an alias for backwards compatibility","Can be used with npx @salesforce/b2c-cli for non-global installations"],"zh":["使用 B2C CLI 创建和删除 On-demand sandboxes (ODS)","支持使用 MCP 管理 Salesforce Commerce","提供 Tooling SDK 进行沙盒管理","使用 `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` 代替全局安装的 B2C CLI","支持 `ods` 前缀作为别名"],"ja":["B2C CLI を使用して On-demand sandboxes (ODS) を作成および削除","MCP を使用して Salesforce Commerce を管理","Tooling SDK を使用してサンドボックスを管理","`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` を使用してグローバルにインストールされた B2C CLI を代替","`ods` プレフィックスを別名としてサポート"],"ko":["B2C CLI를 사용하여 On-demand sandboxes (ODS) 생성 및 삭제","MCP를 사용하여 Salesforce Commerce 관리","Tooling SDK를 사용하여 샌드박스 관리","`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`를 사용하여 전역 설치된 B2C CLI를 대체","`ods` 접두사를 별칭으로 지원"],"es":["Gestión de sandboxes de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","Uso del plugin CLI b2c para crear y eliminar sandboxes","Compatibilidad con el prefijo ''ods'' como alias","Soporte para la ejecución de comandos con ''npx @salesforce/b2c-cli''","Confirmación de acciones destructivas antes de su ejecución","Creación y eliminación de sandboxes solo cuando se solicita explícitamente"],"fr":["Gestion des sandboxes de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","Utilisation du plugin CLI b2c pour créer et supprimer des sandboxes","Compatibilité avec le préfixe ''ods'' comme alias","Support pour l''exécution de commandes avec ''npx @salesforce/b2c-cli''","Confirmation des actions destructives avant leur exécution","Création et suppression de sandboxes uniquement lorsqu''elles sont explicitement demandées"],"de":["Verwaltung von Sandboxes von Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","Verwendung des b2c-CLI-Plugins zur Erstellung und Löschung von Sandboxes","Kompatibilität mit dem Präfix ''ods'' als Alias","Unterstützung für die Ausführung von Befehlen mit ''npx @salesforce/b2c-cli''","Bestätigung von destruktiven Aktionen vor ihrer Ausführung","Erstellung und Löschung von Sandboxes nur wenn explizit angefordert"],"pt":["Criação e gerenciamento de sandboxes On-demand","Uso do plugin b2c CLI","Compatibilidade com Salesforce B2C Commerce","Suporte ao prefixo ''ods''","Execução de comandos com ''npx @salesforce/b2c-cli''"],"ru":["Создание и управление песочницами On-demand","Использование плагина b2c CLI","Совместимость с Salesforce B2C Commerce","Поддержка префикса ''ods''","Выполнение команд с ''npx @salesforce/b2c-cli''"],"ar":["إنشاء وإدارة بيئات التطوير المخصصة","استخدام إضافة ب2c CLI","التوافق مع شركة Salesforce B2C Commerce","دعم بادئة ''ods''","تشغيل أوامر مع ''npx @salesforce/b2c-cli''"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use b2c-sandbox","b2c-sandbox setup guide","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandbox management","b2c CLI plugin tutorial","b2c-sandbox alternative","b2c-sandbox vs Salesforce CLI","b2c-sandbox install","what is b2c-sandbox","b2c-sandbox documentation"],"zh":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce Commerce","On-demand sandboxes","ODS","B2C CLI","MCP","Tooling SDK","AIエージェント","Salesforce Commerce AIエージェント"],"ja":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce Commerce","On-demand sandboxes","ODS","B2C CLI","MCP","Tooling SDK","AIエージェント","Salesforce Commerce AIエージェント"],"ko":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce Commerce","On-demand sandboxes","ODS","B2C CLI","MCP","Tooling SDK","인공지능 에이전트","Salesforce Commerce 인공지능 에이전트"],"es":["b2c-sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","plugin CLI b2c","gestión de sandboxes","creación de sandboxes","eliminación de sandboxes","Herramientas de AI para Salesforce","Salesforce Agentforce Commerce"],"fr":["b2c-sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","plugin CLI b2c","gestion des sandboxes","création de sandboxes","suppression de sandboxes","Outils d''IA pour Salesforce","Salesforce Agentforce Commerce"],"de":["b2c-sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","b2c-CLI-Plugin","Verwaltung von Sandboxes","Erstellung von Sandboxes","Löschung von Sandboxes","AI-Tools für Salesforce","Salesforce Agentforce Commerce"],"pt":["b2c-sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce","plugin b2c CLI","sandboxes On-demand","desenvolvimento de comércio eletrônico","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["b2c-sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce","плагин b2c CLI","песочницы On-demand","разработка электронной коммерции","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["ب2c-sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce","إضافة ب2c CLI","بيئات التطوير المخصصة","تطوير التجارة الإلكترونية","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"SalesforceCommerceCloud","repo":"b2c-developer-tooling","repoPath":"SalesforceCommerceCloud/b2c-developer-tooling","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"b2c-sandbox","description":"Create and manage (B2C/SFCC/Demandware) on-demand sandboxes (ODS) with the b2c cli. Always reference when using the CLI to create, start, stop, restart, delete, or list on-demand sandboxes (ODS) and development instances.","bodyPreview":"# B2C Sandbox Skill\n\nOnly create or delete sandboxes when explicitly requested. Always confirm destructive actions.\n\nUse the `b2c` CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS). Only create or delete a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable or destructible action.\n\n> **Tip:** If `b2c` is not installed globally, use `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` instead (e.g., `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli sandbox list`).\n\n> **Alias:** The `ods` prefix is still supported as a backwa","body":"# B2C Sandbox Skill\n\nOnly create or delete sandboxes when explicitly requested. Always confirm destructive actions.\n\nUse the `b2c` CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS). Only create or delete a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable or destructible action.\n\n> **Tip:** If `b2c` is not installed globally, use `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` instead (e.g., `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli sandbox list`).\n\n> **Alias:** The `ods` prefix is still supported as a backward-compatible alias (e.g., `b2c ods list` works the same as `b2c sandbox list`).\n\n## Sandbox ID Formats\n\nCommands that operate on a specific sandbox accept two ID formats:\n\n- **UUID**: The full sandbox UUID (e.g., `abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789`)\n- **Realm-instance**: The realm-instance format (e.g., `zzzv-123` or `zzzv_123`)\n\nThe realm-instance format uses the 4-character realm code followed by a dash or underscore and the instance number. When using a realm-instance format, the CLI will automatically look up the corresponding UUID.\n\n## Examples\n\n### List Sandboxes\n\n```bash\nb2c sandbox list\n\n# for realm zzpq with JSON output\nb2c sandbox list --realm zzpq --json\n\n# filter by status and those created by a specific user, only print the columns id,state,hostname\nb2c sandbox list --filter-params ''state=started,creating&createdBy=clavery@salesforce.com'' --realm zzpq --columns id,state,hostname\n```\n\n### Create Sandbox\n\nOnly create a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable action.\n\n```bash\n# create in realm zzpq with 4 hour TTL (0 = infinite); json output and wait for completion (this may take 5-10 minutes; timeout is 10 minutes)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --ttl 4 --json --wait\n\n# create in realm zzpq with large profile (medium is default)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --profile large\n\n# create without automatic OCAPI/WebDAV permissions\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --no-set-permissions\n\n# use a different client ID for default permissions\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --permissions-client-id my-other-client\n\n# custom OCAPI settings (replaces defaults)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --ocapi-settings ''[{\"client_id\":\"my-client\",\"resources\":[{\"resource_id\":\"/code_versions\",\"methods\":[\"get\"]}]}]''\n\n# with start/stop scheduler\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --start-scheduler ''{\"weekdays\":[\"MONDAY\",\"TUESDAY\"],\"time\":\"08:00:00Z\"}'' --stop-scheduler ''{\"weekdays\":[\"MONDAY\",\"TUESDAY\"],\"time\":\"19:00:00Z\"}''\n\n# get full log trace output to debug\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --log-level trace\n```\n\n### Get/Start/Stop/Restart/Delete Sandbox\n\nCommands that operate on a specific sandbox support both UUID and realm-instance formats:\n\n```bash\n# Using UUID\nb2c sandbox get abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\nb2c sandbox start abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\nb2c sandbox stop abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\n\n# Using realm-instance format\nb2c sandbox get zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox start zzzv_123\nb2c sandbox stop zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox restart zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox delete zzzv-123 --force\n```\n\n### More Commands\n\nSee `b2c sandbox --help` for a full list of available commands and options in the `sandbox` topic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:51.800Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Salesforce-focused AI Agents requiring efficient management of B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes","zh":"适用于需要高效管理B2C Commerce On-demand沙盒的Salesforce专注AI代理","ja":"Salesforceに焦点を当てたAIエージェントがB2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックスを効率的に管理する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"B2C Commerce On-demand 샌드박스를 효율적으로 관리해야 하는 Salesforce 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA enfocados en Salesforce que requieren una gestión eficiente de entornos de sandbox de Commerce On-demand B2C","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Salesforce nécessitant une gestion efficace des environnements de sandbox de Commerce On-demand B2C","de":"Ideal für Salesforce-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine effiziente Verwaltung von B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA focados no Salesforce que requerem gerenciamento eficiente de areias de B2C Commerce On-demand","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Salesforce, требующих эффективного управления песочницами B2C Commerce On-demand","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على Salesforce والذين يتطلبون إدارة فعالة للمحطات التجارية B2C Commerce On-demand"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes using the b2c CLI plugin, enabling creation, deletion, and listing of sandboxes with explicit confirmation for destructive actions, leveraging the `b2c` command-line interface or `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` for non-global installations","zh":"通过b2c CLI插件赋予代理管理Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand沙盒的能力，实现沙盒的创建、删除和列出，并为破坏性操作提供明确的确认，利用`b2c`命令行接口或`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`进行非全局安装","ja":"b2c CLIプラグインを使用して、Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックスを管理するエージェントを有効にし、サンドボックスの作成、削除、リストinguを可能にし、破壊的な操作には明示的な確認が必要となり、`b2c`コマンドラインインターフェイスまたは`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`を使用して非グローバルインストールを行う","ko":"b2c CLI 플러그인을 사용하여 Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand 샌드박스를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하여 샌드박스의 생성, 삭제 및 목록을 가능하게 하며, 파괴적인 작업에 대한 명시적인 확인이 필요하며, `b2c` 명령줄 인터페이스 또는 `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`를 사용하여 비전역 설치를 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar entornos de sandbox de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand utilizando el plugin de CLI de b2c, lo que permite la creación, eliminación y lista de sandbox con confirmación explícita para acciones destructivas, aprovechando la interfaz de línea de comandos `b2c` o `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` para instalaciones no globales","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les environnements de sandbox de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand en utilisant le plugin de ligne de commande b2c, permettant la création, la suppression et la liste des sandbox avec confirmation explicite pour les actions destructrices, en exploitant l''interface de ligne de commande `b2c` ou `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` pour les installations non globales","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxen mithilfe des b2c-CLI-Plugins zu verwalten, wodurch die Erstellung, Löschung und Auflistung von Sandboxen mit expliziter Bestätigung für destruktive Aktionen ermöglicht wird, indem die `b2c`-Kommandozeilenoberfläche oder `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` für nicht globale Installationen genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar areias de B2C Commerce On-demand do Salesforce usando o plugin b2c CLI, permitindo criação, exclusão e listagem de areias com confirmação explícita para ações destrutivas, utilizando a interface de linha de comando `b2c` ou `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` para instalações não globais","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять песочницами B2C Commerce On-demand от Salesforce, используя плагин b2c CLI, что позволяет создавать, удалять и перечислять песочницы с явным подтверждением для разрушительных действий, используя командную строку `b2c` или `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` для не глобальных установок","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة محطات التجارة الإلكترونية B2C Commerce On-demand من Salesforce باستخدام إضافة ب2س CLI ، مما يتيح إنشاء وحذف وتبويب المحطات بتحقق صريح للإجراءات التدميرية ، باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `b2c` أو `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` للتثبيتات غير العالمية"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating temporary sandboxes for testing and development","Deleting unused sandboxes to avoid unnecessary billing","Listing available sandboxes for environment management"],"zh":["为测试和开发创建临时沙盒","删除未使用的沙盒以避免不必要的计费","列出可用的沙盒以进行环境管理"],"ja":["テストと開発のために一時的なサンドボックスを作成する","使用していないサンドボックスを削除して不要な課金を避ける","利用可能なサンドボックスをリストして環境管理を行う"],"ko":["테스트 및 개발을 위한 임시 샌드박스를 생성","사용하지 않은 샌드박스를 삭제하여 불필요한 청구를 피함","활용 가능한 샌드박스를 나열하여 환경 관리를 수행"],"es":["Creación de entornos de sandbox temporales para pruebas y desarrollo","Eliminación de entornos de sandbox no utilizados para evitar una facturación innecesaria","Lista de entornos de sandbox disponibles para la gestión del entorno"],"fr":["Création de sandbox temporaires pour les tests et le développement","Suppression de sandbox inutilisés pour éviter une facturation inutile","Liste des sandbox disponibles pour la gestion de l''environnement"],"de":["Erstellen von temporären Sandboxen für Tests und Entwicklung","Löschen von nicht genutzten Sandboxen, um unnötige Abrechnung zu vermeiden","Auflistung der verfügbaren Sandboxen für die Umgebungsverwaltung"],"pt":["Criar areias temporárias para testes e desenvolvimento","Excluir areias não utilizadas para evitar cobranças desnecessárias","Listar areias disponíveis para gerenciamento de ambiente"],"ru":["Создание временных песочниц для тестирования и разработки","Удаление неиспользуемых песочниц для избежания ненужного выставления счетов","Перечисление доступных песочниц для управления окружением"],"ar":["إنشاء محطات مؤقتة للاختبار والتنمية","حذف المحطات غير المستخدمة لتجنب الفواتير غير الضرورية","قائمة المحطات المتاحة لإدارة البيئة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of the b2c CLI plugin or use of `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Explicit confirmation needed for destructive actions like deletion","Limited to Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes"],"zh":["需要安装b2c CLI插件或使用`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","需要对破坏性操作（如删除）进行明确确认","仅限于Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand沙盒"],"ja":["b2c CLIプラグインのインストールまたは`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`の使用が必要","破壊的な操作（削除など）には明示的な確認が必要","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックスのみ"],"ko":["b2c CLI 플러그인의 설치 또는 `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`의 사용이 필요","파괴적인 작업(삭제 등)에 대한 명시적인 확인이 필요","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand 샌드박스만"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del plugin de CLI de b2c o el uso de `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Se requiere confirmación explícita para acciones destructivas como la eliminación","Limitado a entornos de sandbox de Commerce On-demand B2C de Salesforce"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du plugin de ligne de commande b2c ou l''utilisation de `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Confirmation explicite requise pour les actions destructrices comme la suppression","Limité aux environnements de sandbox de Commerce On-demand B2C de Salesforce"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des b2c-CLI-Plugins oder die Verwendung von `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Explizite Bestätigung erforderlich für destruktive Aktionen wie Löschung","Begrenzt auf Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do plugin b2c CLI ou uso de `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Confirmação explícita necessária para ações destrutivas como exclusão","Limitado a areias de B2C Commerce On-demand do Salesforce"],"ru":["Требуется установка плагина b2c CLI или использование `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","Необходимо явное подтверждение для разрушительных действий, таких как удаление","Ограничен для песочниц B2C Commerce On-demand от Salesforce"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت إضافة ب2س CLI أو استخدام `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`","تحقق صريح مطلوب للإجراءات التدميرية مثل الحذف","محدود لمحطات التجارة الإلكترونية B2C Commerce On-demand من Salesforce"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a98a12436a404202e43a0780b72a849e42b6d47aebf7f6a8c3b0557a2a1e8a1b","qualityScore":57}');
