INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('SalesforceCommerceCloud/b2c-developer-tooling/b2c-sandbox', 'b2c-sandbox', 'SalesforceCommerceCloud', 'b2c-developer-tooling', 'community', 'b2c-sandbox SalesforceCommerceCloud b2c-developer-tooling community The b2c-sandbox skill manages Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes using the b2c CLI plugin, benefiting developers and administrators who need to create, delete, or list sandboxes. B2C Sandbox 是一种 Salesforce Commerce AIエージェント，用于管理 On-demand sandboxes (ODS) 和 Tooling SDK。使用 B2C CLI 创建和删除沙盒。 B2C Sandbox は、Salesforce Commerce の On-demand sandboxes (ODS) と Tooling SDK を管理する AIエージェントです。B2C CLI を使用してサンドボックスを作成および削除します。 B2C Sandbox는 On-demand sandboxes (ODS) 및 Tooling SDK를 관리하는 Salesforce Commerce 인공지능 에이전트입니다. B2C CLI를 사용하여 샌드박스를 생성 및 삭제합니다. El skill b2c-sandbox permite la gestión de sandboxes de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand utilizando el plugin CLI b2c Le skill b2c-sandbox permet la gestion des sandboxes de Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand à l''aide du plugin CLI b2c Das b2c-sandbox-Skill ermöglicht die Verwaltung von Sandboxes von Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand mithilfe des b2c-CLI-Plugins O b2c-sandbox é uma habilidade que permite criar e gerenciar sandboxes On-demand do Salesforce B2C Commerce usando o plugin b2c CLI. ИИ Агент b2c-sandbox позволяет создавать и управлять песочницами Salesforce B2C Commerce с помощью плагина b2c CLI. وظيفة ب2c-sandbox تتيح إنشاء وإدارة بيئات التطوير المخصصة لشركة Salesforce B2C Commerce باستخدام إضافة ب2c CLI. how to use b2c-sandbox b2c-sandbox setup guide Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandbox management b2c CLI plugin tutorial b2c-sandbox alternative b2c-sandbox vs Salesforce CLI b2c-sandbox install what is b2c-sandbox b2c-sandbox documentation B2C Sandbox Salesforce Commerce On-demand sandboxes ODS B2C CLI MCP Tooling SDK AIエージェント Salesforce Commerce AIエージェント Uses the b2c CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes Creates and deletes sandboxes only when explicitly requested Confirms destructive actions to prevent accidental sandbox deletion Supports the ods prefix as an alias for backwards compatibility Can be used with npx @salesforce/b2c-cli for non-global installations b2c-sandbox is a skill for managing Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes, allowing for creation, deletion, and listing of sandboxes using the b2c CLI plugin.');
