التطبيقات التي تحليل طلبات المستخدمين وتحدد مجموعة التكنولوجيا"},"definition":{"en":"app-builder is an application building orchestrator that analyzes user requests, determines the tech stack, plans the structure, and coordinates agents for efficient project execution.","zh":"应用构建器是一种AI驱动的应用程序构建工具","ja":"アプリケーションビルダーは、AIエージェントを使用したアプリケーションビルドツールです","ko":"애플리케이션 빌더는 AI 에이전트를 사용한 애플리케이션 빌드 도구입니다","es":"App Builder es una herramienta de orquestación de aplicaciones que automatiza la creación de aplicaciones personalizadas","fr":"App Builder est un outil d''orchestration d''applications qui automatise la création d''applications sur mesure","de":"App Builder ist ein Anwendungs-Orchestrierungstool, das die Erstellung individueller Anwendungen automatisiert","pt":"O App Builder é uma ferramenta de orquestração de aplicativos que analisa solicitações de usuários e determina a pilha de tecnologia","ru":"App Builder - это инструмент для создания приложений ИИ Агенты, который анализирует запросы пользователей и определяет технологическую стек","ar":"بناء التطبيقات هو أداة لorchestration التطبيقات التي تحليل طلبات المستخدمين وتحدد مجموعة التكنولوجيا"},"features":{"en":["Analyzes user requests to determine the optimal tech stack","Plans project structure based on the detected project type","Coordinates agents for efficient application building","Utilizes a keyword matrix for project type detection as described in project-detection.md","References the 2025 default stack and alternatives from tech-stack.md for tech stack determination"],"zh":["分析用户请求","确定技术栈","规划结构","协调代理","支持project-detection.md和tech-stack.md文件"],"ja":["ユーザーのリクエストを分析する","テクノロジー・スタックを決定する","構造を計画する","エージェントを調整する","project-detection.mdとtech-stack.mdファイルをサポートする"],"ko":["사용자의 요청을 분석합니다","기술 스택을 결정합니다","구조를 계획합니다","에이전트를 조정합니다","project-detection.md와 tech-stack.md 파일을 지원합니다"],"es":["Análisis de solicitudes de usuarios para determinar la pila tecnológica","Coordinación de agentes para la creación de aplicaciones personalizadas","Utiliza tecnologías como Python y React","Permite la creación de aplicaciones personalizadas con una amplia gama de funcionalidades","Incluye un conjunto de herramientas para la detección de proyectos y la selección de la pila tecnológica"],"fr":["Analyse des demandes des utilisateurs pour déterminer la pile technologique","Coordination d''agents pour la création d''applications sur mesure","Utilise des technologies comme Python et React","Permet la création d''applications sur mesure avec une large gamme de fonctionnalités","Inclut un ensemble d''outils pour la détection de projets et la sélection de la pile technologique"],"de":["Analyse von Benutzeranfragen zur Bestimmung der Technologie-Stack","Koordinierung von Agenten für die Erstellung individueller Anwendungen","Verwendet Technologien wie Python und React","Ermöglicht die Erstellung individueller Anwendungen mit einer breiten Palette von Funktionen","Enthält ein Set von Tools für die Projekterkennung und die Auswahl der Technologie-Stack"],"pt":["Análise de solicitações de usuários","Determinação da pilha de tecnologia","Coordenação de agentes","Planejamento da estrutura do aplicativo","Integração com tecnologias como React e Python"],"ru":["Анализ запросов пользователей","Определение технологической стека","Координация агентов","Планирование структуры приложения","Интеграция с технологиями как React и Python"],"ar":["تحليل طلبات المستخدمين","تحديد مجموعة التكنولوجيا","تنسيق الوكلاء","تخطيط هيكل التطبيق","التكامل مع التكنولوجيا مثل React و Python"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use app-builder","app-builder alternative","app-builder setup guide","what is app-builder","app-builder vs other orchestrators","app-builder install","app-builder for AI agents","application building orchestrator","tech stack determination","project type detection"],"zh":["应用构建器","AI应用构建","技术栈","项目检测","tech-stack.md","应用程序构建","AI驱动的应用程序构建","应用构建工具"],"ja":["アプリケーションビルダー","AIエージェント","アプリケーションビルド","テクノロジー・スタック","プロジェクト検出","tech-stack.md","アプリケーション構築","AI駆動のアプリケーションビルド","アプリケーションビルドツール"],"ko":["애플리케이션 빌더","AI 에이전트","애플리케이션 빌드","기술 스택","프로젝트 감지","tech-stack.md","애플리케이션構築","AI 에이전트를 사용한 애플리케이션 빌드","애플리케이션 빌드 도구"],"es":["app builder","herramienta de orquestación","creación de aplicaciones personalizadas","tecnologías como Python y React","detección de proyectos","selección de la pila tecnológica","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo","agentes de orquestación"],"fr":["app builder","outil d''orchestration","création d''applications sur mesure","technologies comme Python et React","détection de projets","sélection de la pile technologique","développement d''applications","outils de développement","agents d''orchestration"],"de":["app builder","orchestrierungstool","erstellung individueller anwendungen","technologien wie python und react","projekterkennung","auswahl der technologie-stack","anwendungsentwicklung","entwicklungstools","orchestrierungsagenten"],"pt":["app builder","orquestração de aplicativos","análise de solicitações de usuários","determinação da pilha de tecnologia","coordenação de agentes","planejamento da estrutura do aplicativo","react","python","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["app builder","создание приложений","ИИ Агенты","анализ запросов пользователей","определение технологической стека","координация агентов","планирование структуры приложения","react","python","инструменты для разработки"],"ar":["بناء التطبيقات","أداة لorchestration التطبيقات","تحليل طلبات المستخدمين","تحديد مجموعة التكنولوجيا","تنسيق الوكلاء","تخطيط هيكل التطبيق","react","python","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ihmorol","repo":"data-collection-web","repoPath":"ihmorol/data-collection-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.435Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"app-builder","description":"Main application building orchestrator. Creates full-stack applications from natural language requests. Determines project type, selects tech stack, coordinates agents.","bodyPreview":"# App Builder - Application Building Orchestrator\n\n> Analyzes user''s requests, determines tech stack, plans structure, and coordinates agents.\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `project-detection.md` | Keyword matrix, project type detection | Starting new project |\n| `tech-stack.md` | 2025 default stack, alternatives | Choosing techno","body":"# App Builder - Application Building Orchestrator\n\n> Analyzes user''s requests, determines tech stack, plans structure, and coordinates agents.\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `project-detection.md` | Keyword matrix, project type detection | Starting new project |\n| `tech-stack.md` | 2025 default stack, alternatives | Choosing technologies |\n| `agent-coordination.md` | Agent pipeline, execution order | Coordinating multi-agent work |\n| `scaffolding.md` | Directory structure, core files | Creating project structure |\n| `feature-building.md` | Feature analysis, error handling | Adding features to existing project |\n| `templates/SKILL.md` | **Project templates** | Scaffolding new project |\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Templates (13)\n\nQuick-start scaffolding for new projects. **Read the matching template only!**\n\n| Template | Tech Stack | When to Use |\n|----------|------------|-------------|\n| [nextjs-fullstack](templates/nextjs-fullstack/TEMPLATE.md) | Next.js + Prisma | Full-stack web app |\n| [nextjs-saas](templates/nextjs-saas/TEMPLATE.md) | Next.js + Stripe | SaaS product |\n| [nextjs-static](templates/nextjs-static/TEMPLATE.md) | Next.js + Framer | Landing page |\n| [nuxt-app](templates/nuxt-app/TEMPLATE.md) | Nuxt 3 + Pinia | Vue full-stack app |\n| [express-api](templates/express-api/TEMPLATE.md) | Express + JWT | REST API |\n| [python-fastapi](templates/python-fastapi/TEMPLATE.md) | FastAPI | Python API |\n| [react-native-app](templates/react-native-app/TEMPLATE.md) | Expo + Zustand | Mobile app |\n| [flutter-app](templates/flutter-app/TEMPLATE.md) | Flutter + Riverpod | Cross-platform mobile |\n| [electron-desktop](templates/electron-desktop/TEMPLATE.md) | Electron + React | Desktop app |\n| [chrome-extension](templates/chrome-extension/TEMPLATE.md) | Chrome MV3 | Browser extension |\n| [cli-tool](templates/cli-tool/TEMPLATE.md) | Node.js + Commander | CLI app |\n| [monorepo-turborepo](templates/monorepo-turborepo/TEMPLATE.md) | Turborepo + pnpm | Monorepo |\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Agents\n\n| Agent | Role |\n|-------|------|\n| `project-planner` | Task breakdown, dependency graph |\n| `frontend-specialist` | UI components, pages |\n| `backend-specialist` | API, business logic |\n| `database-architect` | Schema, migrations |\n| `devops-engineer` | Deployment, preview |\n\n---\n\n## Usage Example\n\n```\nUser: \"Make an Instagram clone with photo sharing and likes\"\n\nApp Builder Process:\n1. Project type: Social Media App\n2. Tech stack: Next.js + Prisma + Cloudinary + Clerk\n3. Create plan:\n   ├─ Database schema (users, posts, likes, follows)\n   ├─ API routes (12 endpoints)\n   ├─ Pages (feed, profile, upload)\n   └─ Components (PostCard, Feed, LikeButton)\n4. Coordinate agents\n5. Report progress\n6. Start preview\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:38.234Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined application building and tech stack planning.","zh":"非常适合需要简化应用程序构建和技术栈规划的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがアプリケーションの構築とテクノロジースタックの計画を効率化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 애플리케이션 구축 및 기술 스택 계획을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una creación de aplicaciones simplificada y una planificación de la pila tecnológica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une création d''applications rationalisée et d''une planification de la pile technologique.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine vereinfachte Anwendungsentwicklung und eine Technologie-Stack-Planung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de construção de aplicativos simplificada e planejamento de pilha de tecnologia.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима упрощенная разработка приложений и планирование технологического стека.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء تطبيق مبسط وتخطيط حزمة تقنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze user requests, determine optimal tech stacks, and plan project structures using keyword matrices and default tech stacks like those outlined in ''tech-stack.md'', coordinating agents for efficient application development.","zh":"赋予代理分析用户请求、确定最佳技术栈并使用关键字矩阵和默认技术栈（如 ''tech-stack.md'' 中概述的那样）规划项目结构，协调代理以实现高效的应用程序开发。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーのリクエストを分析し、最適なテクノロジースタックを決定し、キーワード行列と ''tech-stack.md'' に概説されているようなデフォルトのテクノロジースタックを使用してプロジェクト構造を計画し、効率的なアプリケーション開発のためのエージェントの調整を行うことを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 요청을 분석하고 최적의 기술 스택을 결정하며 키워드 매트릭스와 ''tech-stack.md''에 요약된 대로 기본 기술 스택을 사용하여 프로젝트 구조를 계획하고 효율적인 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 에이전트 조정을 위해 협력할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar solicitudes de usuarios, determinar pilas tecnológicas óptimas y planificar estructuras de proyectos utilizando matrices de palabras clave y pilas tecnológicas predeterminadas como las descritas en ''tech-stack.md'', coordinando agentes para un desarrollo de aplicaciones eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les demandes des utilisateurs, de déterminer les piles technologiques optimales et de planifier les structures de projet à l''aide de matrices de mots clés et de piles technologiques par défaut comme celles décrites dans ''tech-stack.md'', en coordonnant les agents pour un développement d''applications efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benutzeranfragen zu analysieren, optimale Technologie-Stacks zu bestimmen und Projektstrukturen mithilfe von Schlüsselwortmatrizen und Standard-Technologie-Stacks wie in ''tech-stack.md'' beschrieben zu planen, indem Agenten für eine effiziente Anwendungsentwicklung koordiniert werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem solicitações de usuário, determinem pilhas de tecnologia ótimas e planejem estruturas de projeto usando matrizes de palavras-chave e pilhas de tecnologia padrão, como as descritas em ''tech-stack.md'', coordenando agentes para desenvolvimento de aplicativos eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать запросы пользователей, определять оптимальные технологические стеки и планировать структуру проекта с помощью матриц ключевых слов и стандартных технологических стеков, как описано в ''tech-stack.md'', координируя агентов для эффективной разработки приложений.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تحليل طلبات المستخدم، وتحديد حزم تقنية مثالية، وتخطيط هيكل المشروع باستخدام مصفوفات الكلمات الرئيسية والحزم التقنية الافتراضية، كما هو موضح في ''tech-stack.md''، وتنسيق العملاء من أجل بناء تطبيقات فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project structure planning","Determining optimal tech stacks for web applications","Coordinating agent workflows for efficient app building"],"zh":["自动化项目结构规划","确定 Web 应用程序的最佳技术栈","协调代理工作流以实现高效的应用程序构建"],"ja":["プロジェクト構造計画の自動化","Web アプリケーションの最適なテクノロジースタックの決定","効率的なアプリケーション構築のためのエージェントのワークフロー調整"],"ko":["프로젝트 구조 계획 자동화","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 최적의 기술 스택 결정","효율적인 애플리케이션 구축을 위한 에이전트 워크플로우 조정"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de la estructura del proyecto","Determinación de pilas tecnológicas óptimas para aplicaciones web","Coordinación de flujos de trabajo de agentes para una construcción eficiente de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification de la structure de projet","Détermination de piles technologiques optimales pour les applications web","Coordination des flux de travail des agents pour une construction d''applications efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projektstrukturplanung","Bestimmung optimaler Technologie-Stacks für Webanwendungen","Koordination von Agenten-Workflows für eine effiziente Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Automatizar a planejamento da estrutura do projeto","Determinar pilhas de tecnologia ótimas para aplicações web","Coordenar fluxos de trabalho de agente para construção de aplicativos eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование структуры проекта","Определить оптимальные технологические стеки для веб-приложений","Координировать рабочие процессы агентов для эффективной разработки приложений"],"ar":["توسيع تلقائي لتخطيط هيكل المشروع","تحديد حزم تقنية مثالية للتطبيقات الويب","تنسيق تدفقات العمل للعميل من أجل بناء تطبيقات فعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ''project-detection.md'' and ''tech-stack.md'' files","Limited to application development projects"],"zh":["需要访问 ''project-detection.md'' 和 ''tech-stack.md'' 文件","仅限应用程序开发项目"],"ja":["''project-detection.md'' および ''tech-stack.md'' ファイルへのアクセスが必要","アプリケーション開発プロジェクトのみに限定"],"ko":["''project-detection.md'' 및 ''tech-stack.md'' 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","애플리케이션 개발 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos ''project-detection.md'' y ''tech-stack.md''","Limitado a proyectos de desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers ''project-detection.md'' et ''tech-stack.md''","Limité aux projets de développement d''applications"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dateien ''project-detection.md'' und ''tech-stack.md''","Begrenzt auf Anwendungsentwicklungsprojekte"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos arquivos ''project-detection.md'' e ''tech-stack.md''","Limitado a projetos de desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам ''project-detection.md'' и ''tech-stack.md''","Ограничен проектами разработки приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملفات ''project-detection.md'' و ''tech-stack.md''","محدود بمشاريع بناء التطبيقات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0169334a5adab93cfb503fab2c66aa377c2a7177e49c3b0c0094365eb3bb5baa","qualityScore":57}');
