ystem. It is used when a user asks about performing a common task or expresses interest in extending their agent''s capabilities.","zh":"Find Skills是一种使用GitHub Action评估贡献者质量的技能","ja":"Find Skillsは、GitHub Actionを使用してコントリビューターの品質を評価するスキル","ko":"Find Skills는 GitHub Action을 사용하여 기여자의 품질을 평가하는 스킬입니다","es":"find-skills es una herramienta de evaluación de contribuyentes que utiliza métricas objetivas para determinar la calidad del código y combatir el spam","fr":"find-skills est un outil d''évaluation des contributeurs qui utilise des métriques objectives pour déterminer la qualité du code et combattre le spam","de":"find-skills ist ein Bewertungstool für Mitwirkende, das objektive Metriken verwendet, um die Qualität des Codes zu bestimmen und Spam zu bekämpfen","pt":"O que é Find-Skills? Uma ação do GitHub que avalia a qualidade dos contribuidores com métricas objetivas","ru":"Что такое Find-Skills? Действие GitHub, которое оценивает качество вкладчиков с помощью объективных метрик ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هو Find-Skills؟ إجراء GitHub يقوم بتقييم جودة المساهمين باستخدام معايير موضوعية"},"features":{"en":["Discovers existing skills for common tasks from the open agent ecosystem","Installs skills based on user queries like ''how do I do X''","Responds to direct search commands like ''find a skill for X''","Extends agent capabilities by adding specialized functionalities","Searches for tools, templates, and workflows within the skills ecosystem"],"zh":["使用GitHub Action评估贡献者质量","发现和安装技能","完善代码质量","支持搜索工具、模板和工作流","集成多种技能和功能"],"ja":["GitHub Actionを使用してコントリビューターの品質を評価","スキルを発見してインストール","コード品質を向上させる","ツール、テンプレート、ワークフローの検索をサポート","複数のスキルと機能を統合"],"ko":["GitHub Action을 사용하여 기여자의 품질을 평가","스킬을 검색하여 설치","코드 품질을 개선","도구, 템플릿, 워크플로의 검색을 지원","다양한 스킬과 기능을 통합"],"es":["Evaluación de contribuyentes con métricas objetivas","Detección de spam generado por IA","Combate contra el código de baja calidad","Integración con GitHub Actions","Análisis de código para determinar la calidad","Soporte para la extensión de las capacidades del agente"],"fr":["Évaluation des contributeurs avec des métriques objectives","Détection de spam généré par l''IA","Lutte contre le code de mauvaise qualité","Intégration avec GitHub Actions","Analyse de code pour déterminer la qualité","Support pour l''extension des capacités de l''agent"],"de":["Bewertung von Mitwirkenden mit objektiven Metriken","Erkennung von Spam generiert von KI","Bekämpfung von schlechtem Code","Integration mit GitHub Actions","Code-Analyse zur Bestimmung der Qualität","Unterstützung für die Erweiterung der Agenten-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Avaliação da qualidade dos contribuidores com métricas objetivas","Combate ao spam e código de baixa qualidade","Integração com o GitHub Actions","Uso de métricas para avaliar a qualidade do código","Suporte à descoberta de habilidades e capacidades"],"ru":["Оценка качества вкладчиков с помощью объективных метрик ИИ Агентов","Борьба со спамом и плохим кодом","Интеграция с GitHub Actions","Использование метрик для оценки качества кода","Поддержка обнаружения навыков и возможностей"],"ar":["تقييم جودة المساهمين باستخدام معايير موضوعية","مكافحة البريد العشوائي ورمز المنخفضة الجودة","التكامل مع إجراءات GitHub","استخدام المعايير لتقييم جودة الرمز","دعم اكتشاف المهارات والقدرات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use find-skills","what is find-skills","find-skills install guide","find-skills vs skill discovery","find-skills setup","AI agent skill discovery","extend AI agent capabilities","open agent skills ecosystem"],"zh":["Find Skills","AIエージェント","GitHub Action","代码质量","技能发现","贡献者质量评估","代码搜索","工具搜索"],"ja":["Find Skills","AIエージェント","GitHub Action","コード品質","スキル検索","コントリビューターの品質評価","コード検索","ツール検索"],"ko":["Find Skills","AI 에이전트","GitHub Action","코드 품질","스킬 검색","기여자의 품질 평가","코드 검색","도구 검색"],"es":["find-skills","evaluación de contribuyentes","métricas objetivas","spam generado por IA","código de baja calidad","GitHub Actions","herramientas de desarrollo","agentes de IA","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["find-skills","évaluation des contributeurs","métriques objectives","spam généré par l''IA","code de mauvaise qualité","GitHub Actions","outils de développement","agents d''IA","développement de logiciels"],"de":["find-skills","Bewertung von Mitwirkenden","objektive Metriken","Spam generiert von KI","schlechter Code","GitHub Actions","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agents","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Find-Skills","GitHub Actions","métricas objetivas","combate ao spam","código de baixa qualidade","avaliação da qualidade","descoberta de habilidades","capacidades do GitHub"],"ru":["Find-Skills","GitHub Actions","объективные метрики ИИ Агентов","борьба со спамом","плохой код","оценка качества","обнаружение навыков","возможности GitHub"],"ar":["Find-Skills","إجراءات GitHub","معايير موضوعية","مكافحة البريد العشوائي","رمز المنخفضة الجودة","تقييم الجودة","اكتشاف المهارات","إمكانيات GitHub"]}},"owner":"jdiegosierra","repo":"contributor-report","repoPath":"jdiegosierra/contributor-report","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"find-skills","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a","body":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a specific domain (design, testing, deployment, etc.)\n\n## What is the Skills CLI?\n\nThe Skills CLI (`npx skills`) is the package manager for the open agent skills ecosystem. Skills are modular packages\nthat extend agent capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, and tools.\n\n**Key commands:**\n\n- `npx skills find [query]` - Search for skills interactively or by keyword\n- `npx skills add <package>` - Install a skill from GitHub or other sources\n- `npx skills check` - Check for skill updates\n- `npx skills update` - Update all installed skills\n\n**Browse skills at:** https://skills.sh/\n\n## How to Help Users Find Skills\n\n### Step 1: Understand What They Need\n\nWhen a user asks for help with something, identify:\n\n1. The domain (e.g., React, testing, design, deployment)\n2. The specific task (e.g., writing tests, creating animations, reviewing PRs)\n3. Whether this is a common enough task that a skill likely exists\n\n### Step 2: Search for Skills\n\nRun the find command with a relevant query:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills find [query]\n```\n\nFor example:\n\n- User asks \"how do I make my React app faster?\" → `npx skills find react performance`\n- User asks \"can you help me with PR reviews?\" → `npx skills find pr review`\n- User asks \"I need to create a changelog\" → `npx skills find changelog`\n\nThe command will return results like:\n\n```\nInstall with npx skills add <owner/repo@skill>\n\nvercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n└ https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 3: Present Options to the User\n\nWhen you find relevant skills, present them to the user with:\n\n1. The skill name and what it does\n2. The install command they can run\n3. A link to learn more at skills.sh\n\nExample response:\n\n```\nI found a skill that might help! The \"vercel-react-best-practices\" skill provides\nReact and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering.\n\nTo install it:\nnpx skills add vercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n\nLearn more: https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 4: Offer to Install\n\nIf the user wants to proceed, you can install the skill for them:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills add <owner/repo@skill> -g -y\n```\n\nThe `-g` flag installs globally (user-level) and `-y` skips confirmation prompts.\n\n## Common Skill Categories\n\nWhen searching, consider these common categories:\n\n| Category        | Example Queries                          |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Web Development | react, nextjs, typescript, css, tailwind |\n| Testing         | testing, jest, playwright, e2e           |\n| DevOps          | deploy, docker, kubernetes, ci-cd        |\n| Documentation   | docs, readme, changelog, api-docs        |\n| Code Quality    | review, lint, refactor, best-practices   |\n| Design          | ui, ux, design-system, accessibility     |\n| Productivity    | workflow, automation, git                |\n\n## Tips for Effective Searches\n\n1. **Use specific keywords**: \"react testing\" is better than just \"testing\"\n2. **Try alternative terms**: If \"deploy\" doesn''t work, try \"deployment\" or \"ci-cd\"\n3. **Check popular sources**: Many skills come from `vercel-labs/agent-skills` or `ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills`\n\n## When No Skills Are Found\n\nIf no relevant skills exist:\n\n1. Acknowledge that no existing skill was found\n2. Offer to help with the task directly using your general capabilities\n3. Suggest the user could create their own skill with `npx skills init`\n\nExample:\n\n```\nI searched for skills related to \"xyz\" but didn''t find any matches.\nI can still help you with this task directly! Would you like me to proceed?\n\nIf this is something you do often, you could create your own skill:\nnpx skills init my-xyz-skill\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:06.786Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code seeking to expand their capabilities through the open agent skills ecosystem.","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，通过开放的代理技能生态系统扩展其功能。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントが、オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムを通じて機能を拡張するのに適しています。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트가 오픈 에이전트 스킬 생태계를 통해 기능을 확장하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que buscan expandir sus capacidades a través del ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code qui cherchent à étendre leurs capacités via l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die ihre Fähigkeiten durch das offene Agenten-Skill-Ökosystem erweitern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que buscam expandir suas capacidades por meio do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, стремящихся расширить свои возможности через открытый экосистему навыков агентов.","ar":"مثالية لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يسعون لتوسيع قدراتهم من خلال نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover and install new skills, extending their functionality to address user queries about specialized tasks and capabilities, leveraging protocols and libraries from the open agent skills ecosystem.","zh":"赋予代理发现和安装新技能的能力，扩展其功能以应对用户关于专门任务和功能的查询，利用开放代理技能生态系统的协议和库。","ja":"エージェントに新しいスキルを発見しインストールする能力を与え、専門的なタスクや機能に関するユーザーの問い合わせに対応するために機能を拡張し、オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムのプロトコルやライブラリを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에 새로운 스킬을 발견하고 설치하는 능력을 부여하여 전문적인 작업이나 기능에 대한 사용자의 질의에 응답하는 데 기능을 확장하며 오픈 에이전트 스킬 생태계의 프로토콜과 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes descubrir e instalar nuevas habilidades, extendiendo su funcionalidad para abordar consultas de usuarios sobre tareas y capacidades especializadas, aprovechando protocolos y bibliotecas del ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir et d''installer de nouvelles compétences, en étendant leur fonctionnalité pour répondre aux requêtes des utilisateurs sur des tâches et des capacités spécialisées, en exploitant les protocoles et les bibliothèques de l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, neue Fähigkeiten zu entdecken und zu installieren, und erweitert so ihre Funktionalität, um Anfragen von Benutzern über spezialisierte Aufgaben und Fähigkeiten zu bearbeiten, indem es Protokolle und Bibliotheken des offenen Agenten-Skill-Ökosystems nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrir e instalar novas habilidades, estendendo sua funcionalidade para atender a consultas de usuários sobre tarefas e capacidades especializadas, aproveitando protocolos e bibliotecas do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и устанавливать новые навыки, расширяя их функциональность для решения запросов пользователей о специализированных задачах и возможностях, используя протоколы и библиотеки открытого экосистемы навыков агентов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اكتشاف وتثبيت مهارات جديدة، وتوسيع وظائفهم لمعالجة استفسارات المستخدمين حول المهام والقدرات المتخصصة، واستخدام البروتوكولات والمكتبات من نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح."},"useCases":{"en":["Responding to user queries about unknown tasks or capabilities","Discovering and installing skills for specialized tasks","Extending agent functionality to address gaps in user support","Searching for tools, templates, or workflows to enhance user experience"],"zh":["响应用户关于未知任务或功能的查询","发现和安装专门任务的技能","扩展代理功能以应对用户支持中的差距","搜索工具、模板或工作流以增强用户体验"],"ja":["未知のタスクまたは機能に関するユーザーの問い合わせに応答する","専門的なタスクのスキルを発見しインストールする","ユーザーサポートのギャップを解消するためにエージェントの機能を拡張する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを強化するためのツール、テンプレート、またはワークフローを検索する"],"ko":["Unknown 작업 또는 기능에 대한 사용자의 질의에 응답하는 것","전문적인 작업의 스킬을 발견하고 설치하는 것","사용자 지원의 격차를 해결하기 위해 에이전트의 기능을 확장하는 것","사용자 경험을 향상시키기 위한 도구, 템플릿 또는 워크플로우를 검색하는 것"],"es":["Responder a consultas de usuarios sobre tareas o capacidades desconocidas","Descubrir e instalar habilidades para tareas especializadas","Ampliar la funcionalidad del agente para abordar lagunas en el soporte de usuarios","Buscar herramientas, plantillas o flujos de trabajo para mejorar la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Répondre aux requêtes des utilisateurs sur des tâches ou des capacités inconnues","Découvrir et installer des compétences pour des tâches spécialisées","Étendre la fonctionnalité de l''agent pour répondre aux lacunes dans le soutien des utilisateurs","Rechercher des outils, des modèles ou des flux de travail pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Antworten auf Benutzeranfragen über unbekannte Aufgaben oder Fähigkeiten","Entdecken und Installieren von Fähigkeiten für spezialisierte Aufgaben","Erweitern der Agentenfunktionalität, um Lücken in der Benutzersupport zu schließen","Suchen nach Tools, Vorlagen oder Workflows, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Responder a consultas de usuários sobre tarefas ou capacidades desconhecidas","Descobrir e instalar habilidades para tarefas especializadas","Estender a funcionalidade do agente para atender a lacunas no suporte ao usuário","Pesquisar ferramentas, modelos ou fluxos de trabalho para melhorar a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Отвечать на запросы пользователей о неизвестных задачах или возможностях","Обнаруживать и устанавливать навыки для специализированных задач","Расширять функциональность агента для решения пробелов в поддержке пользователей","Поиск инструментов, шаблонов или рабочих процессов для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["الاستجابة لاستفسارات المستخدمين حول المهام أو القدرات غير المعروفة","اكتشاف وتثبيت مهارات لمهام متخصصة","توسيع وظائف الوكيل لمعالجة الفجوات في دعم المستخدم","البحث عن أدوات أو نماذج أو سير عمل لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the open agent skills ecosystem","Dependent on the availability and compatibility of skills within the ecosystem"],"zh":["需要访问开放的代理技能生态系统","依赖于生态系统内的技能的可用性和兼容性"],"ja":["オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムへのアクセスが必要","エコシステム内でのスキルの可用性と互換性に依存する"],"ko":["오픈 에이전트 스킬 생태계에 대한 액세스가 필요함","생태계 내에서의 스킬의 가용성 및 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas","Depende de la disponibilidad y la compatibilidad de las habilidades dentro del ecosistema"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert","Dépend de la disponibilité et de la compatibilité des compétences au sein de l''écosystème"],"de":["Benötigt Zugang zum offenen Agenten-Skill-Ökosystem","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit und Kompatibilität der Fähigkeiten innerhalb des Ökosystems ab"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto","Depende da disponibilidade e compatibilidade de habilidades dentro do ecossistema"],"ru":["Требует доступа к открытому экосистеме навыков агентов","Зависит от наличия и совместимости навыков внутри экосистемы"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح","يعتمد على توافر ومتانة المهارات داخل النظام"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"2ecead454dcf067ec2ae332fa22d843bdc4f7fcf599ee61d29f1da6c39842813","qualityScore":57}');
